    "text": "\u00deis synd \u00fea madmas \u00fee Adeluuold bisceop sealde into \u00feam mynstre \u00fee is Medeshamstede gehaten Gode\n\u00de\u00e6t is \u00feonne an Cristes boc mid sylure berenod & III rode eac mid sylure berenode, II sylurene\nAnd antwentig is \u00feara boca \u00fee Adeluuold biscop gesealde into Burch.\n\u00de\u00e6t is \u00feonne Beda in Marcum, Liber miraculorum, Expositio Hebreorum nominum, Prouisio futurarum\n\u00deonne is \u00e6t Farresheafde XVI weorcwur\u00f0e men & VIII iunge men & Witlesmere halfendel.\n\u00deonne is Vndelum & to berewicum \u00fearto gebyre\u00f0.\n\u00deonne is Keteiringan.\n\u00deonne sind \u00fea fennas \u00fee he bohte \u00e6t \u00c6alsige & \u00e6t Vfige manige \u00e6t Wellan mid XIII oran.\nOf \u00feam twam hundredum \u00fee sec\u00e6\u00f0 into Normannescros man ageaf to tio\u00f0unge into Medeshamstede\nOf \u00feam twam undredum ute on \u00feam nesse \u00fee Medeshamstede onstent man ageaf of six tunan swa man\n\u00deonne letan \u00fea tio\u00feunge of \u00fean XXIIII tunan man ageald to mynstre twa hund \u00e6cera s\u00e6d & III.\nOf Macuseige fourtene \u00e6cersed tio\u00feunge.\nOf \u00c6sctune tio\u00feunge healf fourtende \u00e6cersed & V georde sed.\nOf Nunnetune VI \u00e6cersed & V giorde sed ti\u00feunge.\nOf \u00fean o\u00feren Macuseige to Tio\u00feunge VIIII \u00e6cersed.\nOf \u00c6stune to ti\u00feunge healf XVIII \u00e6cersed & XIIII giorde sed & III roda sed.\nOf Pilesgete tio\u00feunge VI \u00e6cersed.\n\u00deis is \u00fe\u00e6t erfgewrit \u00e6t Geaceslea, \u00feryttene wepmen weorcewyr\u00fee & V wimmen & \u00e6hta geonge men &\n\u00dea \u00c6theluuine aldorman & Ealdulf biscop sealdan \u00c6thestane & Alfwolde for Iacesle & Faresheued",
